---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="About" description="About nth degree">
  <header class="page-header">
    <h1>About</h1>
  </header>

  <div class="content">
    <p>
      This is a blog about infrastructure — servers, networks, containers, and
      the systems that tie them together. Every post is rooted in something real:
      a Proxmox cluster in my garage, a Kubernetes migration, a networking problem
      I actually had to solve.
    </p>

    <p>
      I also run engineering teams. Some of what's here reflects that — how to
      build platforms, navigate enterprise constraints, or ship through complexity.
      But mostly it's about the hardware and the code.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
